WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.741
Biparjoy, Mocha,

2
00:00:01.741 --> 00:00:03.872
Tauktae. Who picks the names

3
00:00:03.872 --> 00:00:05.978
of cyclones in our region?

4
00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:08.633
Thirteen countries around the north

5
00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:10.903
Indian Ocean contribute names.

6
00:00:10.903 --> 00:00:11.796
In 2020,

7
00:00:11.796 --> 00:00:13.387
a new list of 169

8
00:00:13.387 --> 00:00:15.173
names was released,

9
00:00:15.173 --> 00:00:17.330
thirteen from each.

10
00:00:17.664 --> 00:00:19.903
India's weather department runs the

11
00:00:19.903 --> 00:00:22.123
regional centre in New Delhi

12
00:00:22.123 --> 00:00:24.004
that names cyclones in this

13
00:00:24.004 --> 00:00:24.973
basin.

14
00:00:25.655 --> 00:00:27.134
Names must be short,

15
00:00:27.134 --> 00:00:29.073
neutral and easy to say.

16
00:00:29.073 --> 00:00:30.668
And each name is used

17
00:00:30.668 --> 00:00:31.956
only once.

18
00:00:32.284 --> 00:00:33.555
Your turn.

19
00:00:33.555 --> 00:00:35.296
Who keeps the list?
